<h1 style=3D"margin:0; font-size:30px; line-height:125%"><span style=3D"col=
or: #192733;">The nostalgia factory that=E2=80=99s made millions flipping o=
ld Polaroids</span></h1>
<p style=3D"font-size:18px; line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"font-size:18px; line-height:125%"><span style=3D"color: #192733=
;"><em>In Wisconsin, a team of millennials is working to sell you your chil=
dhood</em></span></p>
<p style=3D"font-size:13px; line-height:125%; font-weight:bold">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"font-size:13px; line-height:125%; font-weight:bold"><br><span s=
tyle=3D"color: #192733;">BY <a href=3D"https://media.hubspot.com/e3t/Ctc/UB=
+113/d2q-Vf04/VVPR2S2mFwdgVKNG3H182gT7W3Jh9SL5JKH4CN63y6md2-ZW0W50kgx26lZ3k=
DV1FpBH263y3vW8LB4JL7M4sjxW7bYxnC5Cm8CbW8SccwP1LxcJlW57vhqn3CjMjGW3NjHl950y=
WZgW3GLnfR6VwbbvW92-9S540ffpQN4z2wW9G6jHwW7Pm8CS7tLfDpW66xGnw216lJmW2g2zfj1=
Hrr0jW3ZrbSh31gQ-1VTznV98pMH33W8B-8v32fCbZNVBv1n45BgRdSf4D60wT04" style=3D"=
font-weight:bold; color:#192733; text-decoration:none !important" rel=3D"no=
opener" data-hs-link-id=3D"0" data-hs-link-id-v2=3D"oE73l/qS" target=3D"_bl=
ank">KATHERINE LAIDLAW</a></span></p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">As a child, <strong>Kori Fuerst</strong> was =
brimming with business ideas. She recorded radio shows on cassette tapes, a=
nd charged her neighbors admission prices to listen to them. She ground up =
leaves in the woods near her house, bottled up the juice, called it insect =
repellent, and put it up for sale.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">=E2=80=9CReally, just any way we could shake =
down our parents and neighbors for money,=E2=80=9D she says, laughing.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">These days, she=E2=80=99s still making money =
off cassette tapes, though now she owns the business and the revenue is in =
the millions.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">Like many millennials, Fuerst is riding a wav=
e of nostalgia. She yearns for the days of Pok=C3=A9mon cards and spends we=
ekends searching for Pixar=E2=80=99s =E2=80=9CCars=E2=80=9D on VHS =E2=80=
=94 a rarity in the vintage collectibles world. And, alongside her husband =
Adam, she=E2=80=99s built <a href=3D"https://media.hubspot.com/e3t/Ctc/UB+1=
13/d2q-Vf04/VVPR2S2mFwdgVKNG3H182gT7W3Jh9SL5JKH4CN63y6md2-ZW0W50kgx26lZ3nGW=
3r8ls28ND8W4W7Mg67W3GCYYvVgDh6V7dC150W3QZrWg7PkRCvW1H5nR871xwdFW8pZY5d5Hlly=
bW5ptQDZ3GHxSqW9bwmRv2J9-JXW3lgXHg8XpyvWW5wT5ZZ4qR10fW6ppwJ-5yXSyKW3-J-043Y=
wNrKW2d8zf57LWP9lW6MWh8T8PK-6CW8JN3ZC5Q7gZkN35Zvc3RNj2Gf6s0CNv04" style=3D"=
color:#192733" data-hs-link-id=3D"0" data-hs-link-id-v2=3D"SkSZnOjj" target=
=3D"_blank">Retrospekt</a>, a retro-tech empire in Milwaukee, turning a fas=
cination for yesteryear and Polaroid cameras into a career.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<h2 style=3D"margin:0; line-height:125%; font-size:18px">The Apple of its t=
ime</h2>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">When Kori and Adam Fuerst first met in 2007, =
they were both big fans of Polaroid.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">Once called =E2=80=9Cthe Apple of its time,=
=E2=80=9D the company controlled nearly two-thirds of the instant-camera ma=
rket in the US at its peak in the 1970s.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">Digital cameras forced the company, which rel=
ied on film sales, into bankruptcy for the first time in 2001.</p></div></d=
