></span></p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">The next year, the Fuersts began to manage a =
team of pickers across the country, still supplying stock to the Impossible=
 Project.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">Alongside their thrifting pursuits, they were=
 in grad school working toward degrees in occupational therapy (Adam) and s=
peech pathology (Kori). Two years into his career at the hospital, Adam rea=
lized that he=E2=80=99d make more money if he stayed home and worked on Ret=
rospekt.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">=E2=80=9CWhen we started it, it was like, =E2=
=80=98can we pay our utilities bill? Can we pay for some groceries? Can we =
pay for books?=E2=80=99=E2=80=9D Adam says. =E2=80=9CWe just moved the goal=
post a little bit, and at one point I was like, =E2=80=98Oh, can we buy a c=
ar?=E2=80=99=E2=80=9D</p></div></div></td></tr></tbody></table>
