<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">We=E2=80=99ve been in an era of the reboot fo=
r what feels like years. Everywhere, companies are making what=E2=80=99s ol=
d cool again. Hollywood=E2=80=99s top-grossing films last year, like most y=
ears, were all sequels or remakes. Motorola produced a line of flip phones =
last year, calling back to their popular =E2=80=9800s Razrs. In 2023, Hasbr=
o even launched a reissued Furby doll.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">Retro tech has been on the rise for years, to=
o. In 2010, <strong>2.8m</strong> vinyl records were sold in the US By 2024=
, that number reached <strong>43.6m</strong>.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">Still, it=E2=80=99s a huge leap to go from sp=
ending $100 on a <a href=3D"https://media.hubspot.com/e3t/Ctc/UB+113/d2q-Vf=
04/VVPR2S2mFwdgVKNG3H182gT7W3Jh9SL5JKH4CN63y6n62-ZW0W6N1vHY6lZ3nFW8RfmCD21q=
0GYW7JL9rj11zjW6N6vmC1G8STPbW611L4r1ddG0RW4nD43m2tbt6qW7tkn_86D3VlZW1jHq715=
q8_VwW7LTcYQ5zz_kdW4tkc1S6nvztgW4ZkwDp3HX4v8Vwv2xS10V3YpW1S8Z923GVfrKW410QW=
X1pFMhGN6-n9RfYd8S_W5KKy1h5hKvSRVkHB3t87J0s6W3h4XJz8J6llyVK7jqn1gfrjbM_2fLt=
JV51dW4fpZ7x3FdtLsN4VCCz63G5PLW2L8hL33DWwmtf8Qf_Rx04" style=3D"color:#19273=
3" data-hs-link-id=3D"0" data-hs-link-id-v2=3D"k7Vt1XKH" target=3D"_blank">=
Smiths cassette tape</a> that reminds you of riding shotgun on trips to the=
 hardware store with your dad to <strong>$2m</strong> on a sealed Super Mar=
io Bros. video game. <a href=3D"https://media.hubspot.com/e3t/Ctc/UB+113/d2=
q-Vf04/VVPR2S2mFwdgVKNG3H182gT7W3Jh9SL5JKH4CN63y6n62-ZW0W6N1vHY6lZ3p0N47fTq=
z3YkHRW4FbVXX1ZLy4DN6kkh4bDRBJdW41-nwH7Drj45MZBvCrd8SbHW2jp--L3dpv63W8zvtGg=
