fn5sF8bmsdqW6jnV7472lkPnM5K3gXCh2b7W9c-y5C4h63Zbf1r9jmq04" style=3D"color:#=
192733" data-hs-link-id=3D"0" data-hs-link-id-v2=3D"ZfgOdjm5" target=3D"_bl=
ank">And yet.</a></p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">In 2021, an anonymous buyer spent $2m on a st=
ill-sealed 1985 Super Mario Bros. game, breaking the previous record of $1.=
56m for the highest price paid for a video game.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">The transaction happened on a platform called=
 Rally, a stock market for collectibles. <a href=3D"https://media.hubspot.c=
om/e3t/Ctc/UB+113/d2q-Vf04/VVPR2S2mFwdgVKNG3H182gT7W3Jh9SL5JKH4CN63y6md2-ZW=
0W50kgx26lZ3lkW65V-Dl7s4dm4W7thWsV6DnYj7W25l47B8y-xp-W71378F7HqL0tN1sfdjS1l=
dk9W1cZyCH6dzcFJW1gGSds53XBnPVbStBD15VNV0W4_ZqL54-ZPTVW7425pN6ct2QLW5Bymcf4=
KsvQ6W8W9qMR5qKcTKW5Lplvq4s7dVSW7T4S3-1yHWGrW1pGgy61q8p-sN1RqRRLvsK57f2q_mX=
K04" style=3D"color:#192733" data-hs-link-id=3D"0" data-hs-link-id-v2=3D"WW=
TvKZdb" target=3D"_blank">Rally</a>, which started ~10 years ago, was creat=
ed on the belief that even if investors couldn=E2=80=99t afford to buy a mu=
seum-quality car or watch, they=E2=80=99d spend money to buy a part of one.=
<span style=3D"font-size: 12px; color: #000000;"> </span></p></div></div></=
