em></span></p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">Essentially, Rally runs tiny IPOs on collecti=
bles, allowing the market to decide how much they=E2=80=99re worth after in=
vestors have bought a portion of the assets. Imagine a real estate portfoli=
o, but for classic cars, watches, baseball cards and, of course, video game=
s.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">The company had spent <strong>$140k</strong> =
to acquire the video game just a year and a half before.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">When <strong>Rob Petrozzo</strong> and his co=
-founders started Rally, their first purchase was a 1977 Lotus Esprit. =E2=
=80=9CAny boy growing up, you think of the poster on the wall of the Lambor=
ghini or Ferrari. It becomes a part of our personality,=E2=80=9D he says. =
=E2=80=9CTo us, the Esprit was an untapped gem. That car is what Elon based=
 Tesla on. It just looks and feels very futuristic for its time.=E2=80=9D</=
p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">They brought the car to the platform in a $46=
k IPO. It =E2=80=9Cexited=E2=80=9D to its new owner for $80k.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">=E2=80=9CWhen we bring something new to marke=
t now, we want to make sure it=E2=80=99s extremely relevant but tells a sto=
ry our users have never heard before,=E2=80=9D he says.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">A quick perusal of Rally=E2=80=99s current of=
ferings includes:</p>
<ul style=3D"line-height:125%">
<li aria-level=3D"1">A Pokemon first edition booster box (suggested market =
cap $23k)</li>
<li aria-level=3D"1">An =E2=80=9818 Shohei Ohtani rookie card (suggested ma=
rket cap $78.7k)</li>
<li aria-level=3D"1">A =E2=80=9894 Lamborghini Diablo (sold for $975k)</li>
<li aria-level=3D"1">An =E2=80=9889 Nintendo Game Boy (suggested market cap=
 $5.6k)</li>
</ul>
<h2 style=3D"margin:0; line-height:125%; font-size:18px">The high of nostal=
gia</h2>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">Nostalgia, it turns out, is a hell of a drug.=
 Research shows it can make us <a href=3D"https://media.hubspot.com/e3t/Ctc=
/UB+113/d2q-Vf04/VVPR2S2mFwdgVKNG3H182gT7W3Jh9SL5JKH4CN63y6mR2-ZW0W69sMD-6l=
Z3nnW3Cch4P6C6WwRN5LV958P8Bq9W3fTpPf3sHnvFW3M7QgM78_sX1W7jzg633ZkXNTMn3Q3Lj=
RTpQVx6SbZ5MYp5jVCyR2851vttBW7pFhVb5frR_KW7xb7GP2JVkYRW3WynJl7lfL7rW79ktzF4=
91BJ0W9hNfG353mSk7W6qWcD47WSBQSW2GKLmC7Y7C9WW27FMCM3ZVW-3W22FwS723sFrZN13Zf=
1hPs__DW3PDCTJ57J9DtV7qDj64tnkl3f14WlJb04" style=3D"color:#192733" data-hs-=
link-id=3D"0" data-hs-link-id-v2=3D"eYCVLAsR" target=3D"_blank">more inclin=
ed</a> to spend money, and <a href=3D"https://media.hubspot.com/e3t/Ctc/UB+=
113/d2q-Vf04/VVPR2S2mFwdgVKNG3H182gT7W3Jh9SL5JKH4CN63y6nK2-ZW0W7Y8-PT6lZ3kN=
W6914ct2-fWY8W8xrlLb27DmmGW4QscrR4BKcNjW4c9XGr2_1hkMW4tSnRZ61dlXCW8fyFpD2bf=
QkYW5VfTLM1h__63VyvtkF4rg2vxW7Y0MCQ3f8RTGW7JJbqD3NVLG6VSmFfq1_VKZpN95hFfRkf=
pl2N127K_sKDDSgW30dfS38mzGryVY6bly2kFzTDN7cJLwl2vt59W8zbXX94z9dD3W2LcptM20r=
vDvVkDr645tR4VJW7phRbg1qFPWyW811zr02F_ZbgW57R1VJ3Ndbs1V_YjJW1SBHC_W46-8TS7M=
wFLbW8s3tc86HbqjVN153kF7876lfdtWy2W04" style=3D"color:#192733" data-hs-link=
-id=3D"0" data-hs-link-id-v2=3D"dkRWPnKM" target=3D"_blank">more likely</a>=
 to donate to charity.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">Beyond that, it has a whole host of other soc=
ial benefits, according to <strong>Evan Weingarten</strong>, assistant prof=
essor of marketing at the University of Southern California=E2=80=99s Marsh=
all School of Business.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">=E2=80=9CFor many hundreds of years, nostalgi=
a was seen as bad. You=E2=80=99re stuck in the past,=E2=80=9D he says. =E2=
=80=9COver the last 20 years, researchers have said, nostalgia=E2=80=99s ac=
tually pretty good for you.=E2=80=9D</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">People who feel more nostalgic see their soci=
al connectedness go up =E2=80=94 they feel more loved, have a stronger sens=
e of self, and are more optimistic and hopeful. Nostalgic advertisements te=
nd to perform better.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">And there=E2=80=99s something else at play he=
re. In an increasingly uncertain world, as the cost of living goes up and u=
p, we use nostalgia to anchor us to simpler times.</p></div></div></td></tr=
></tbody></table>
